{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-32-1","title":"Psalms 32:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Blessedness consists in remission of sins. 3 Confession of sins gives ease to the conscience. 8 God's promises bring joy.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2970. B.C. 1034. (Title.) or, A Psalm of David givinginstruction. 42:1; 45:1; 52:1; 53:1; 55:1; *titles Blessed. 1:1,2; 40:4; 84:12; 89:15; 106:3; 119:1,2; 128:1; Jer 17:7,8 Mt 5:3-12; 16:17; Lu 11:28; Re 22:14 transgression. Isa 1:18; 43:25; 44:22; Mic 7:18,19; Ac 13:38,39; Ro 4:6-8 covered. 85:2; Ne 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-2","title":"Psalms 32:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>The Lord. Le 17:4; Ro 5:13; 2Co 5:19-21 whose. Joh 1:47; 2Co 1:12; 1Pe 2:1,2; Re 14:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-3","title":"Psalms 32:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>When. Ge 3:8-19; 1Sa 31:13; 2Sa 11:27; 12:1-12; 21:12-14; Pr 28:13 Isa 57:17; Jer 31:18,19; Lu 15:15,16 bones. 6:2; 31:9,10; 38:3; 51:8; 102:3-5; Job 30:17,30; La 1:3; 3:4 roaring. 22:1; 38:8; Job 3:24; Isa 51:20; 59:11; La 3:8; Ho 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-4","title":"Psalms 32:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>hand. 38:2-8; 39:10,11; 1Sa 5:6,7,9,11; 6:9; Job 16:21; 33:7 moisture. 22:15; 90:6,7; 102:3,4; Job 30:30; La 4:8; 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-5","title":"Psalms 32:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>acknowledged. 38:18; 51:3-5; Le 26:39,40; Jos 7:19; 2Sa 12:13; 24:10; Job 33:27 Pr 28:13; Jer 3:13; 1Jo 1:8-10 have. Job 31:33; Pr 30:20; Jer 2:23,35; Lu 16:15 I said. Isa 65:24; Ho 6:1; Lu 15:17-19,21 forgavest. 30:5; 86:5,15; 103:3; 2Sa 12:13; Isa 65:24; Jer 31:20; Lu 7:47 Lu 15:20-23; Eph 4:32 iniquity. 51:4; 2Sa 12:9,13; Mal 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-6","title":"Psalms 32:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>For this. 34:2-5; 40:3; 51:12,13; 2Co 1:4; 1Ti 1:16 godly. 4:3; 2Co 7:9,10; Tit 2:12 pray. Pr 1:28; Isa 49:8; 55:6; Lu 19:42-44; Joh 7:34; 2Co 6:2 a time, etc. Heb. a time of finding. in the floods. 42:7; 69:1,2,13-15; 124:4,5; Ge 7:17-22; Isa 43:2; Mt 7:24-27 Re 12:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-7","title":"Psalms 32:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>my. 9:9; 27:5; 31:20; 119:114; 143:9; Jer 36:26; Col 3:3 compass. 10; 5:12; 18:5 songs. 40:3; 98:1; Ex 15:1-3; Jud 5:1; 2Sa 22:1; Re 7:10; 15:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-8","title":"Psalms 32:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>instruct. 34:11; Pr 3:1; 4:1-13; 8:10,11; Mt 11:29 I will guide, etc. Heb. I will counsel thee, mine eye shallbe upon thee. 25:9,10; 33:18; Pr 3:5,6; Isa 49:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-9","title":"Psalms 32:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Be ye. Pr 26:3; Jer 31:18; Jas 3:3; 4:7-10 no. Job 35:11; Jer 4:22; 8:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-10","title":"Psalms 32:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Many. 16:4; 34:19-21; 140:11; Pr 13:21; Ec 8:12; Isa 3:11; 57:21; Ro 2:8,9 1Ti 6:10 but. 2:12; 5:12; 34:8; 40:4; 84:12; 146:5; 147:11; Pr 16:20; Isa 12:2,3 Jer 17:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-32-11","title":"Psalms 32:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":32,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":32,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Be glad. 33:1; 64:10; 68:3; 97:12; De 12:12; 1Sa 2:1; Ro 5:11; Php 3:1,3; 4:4 shout. 5:11; 97:1; 98:4; Ezr 3:11-13; Zec 4:7 upright. 2; 125:4</p>"}]}